  "title": "Legora expands to South Korea with new office in Seoul",
  "summary": "Legora, the agentic operating system for legal professionals trusted by more than 100,000 lawyers at more than 1,500 leading law firms and in-house legal teams across over 50 markets, today announced the opening of an office in Seoul, marking the company's entry into South Korea. The office is Legora's fourth in Asia-Pacific, following Sydney, Singapore and Tokyo.",
